cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the method it implements, please cite it using
  the metadata below. A versioned dataset with its own DOI will be published
  on Zenodo at the first tagged release.
type: software
title: "watts-per-gigabit: reproducible energy-per-bit measurement of open-source 5G UPFs on Kubernetes"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible method and harness to measure joules per gigabit of
  open-source 5G user-plane functions (Open5GS, eUPF, OMEC/SD-Core) running on
  Kubernetes, with RAPL as the reference, external power measurement for
  validation, and Kepler per-pod attribution as an object of study.
